OL,3,GNEWSAMissing cat wandering fell found
OL,4,Aby ramblers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cat who enjoys walks with his family
OL,7,Fhas been reunited with them after being
OL,8,Ffound wandering on a moorland fell.
OL,10,FHarvie Strange said seven-month-old
OL,11,FMoonlight Sparkles had been missing for
OL,12,Fseveral days after vanishing while they
OL,13,Fwere away on holiday.
OL,15,FThe footloose feline was about two
OL,16,Fmiles from the family home in Cowgill,
OL,17,FCumbria, when he was discovered by a
OL,18,Fgroup of walkers who flagged down a car
OL,19,Fwhose driver just happened to be the
OL,20,Fowner's neighbour.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
