OL,3,GNEWSAMissing cat wandering fell found
OL,4,Aby ramblers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Whelan-Smith, who was leading
OL,7,Fthe walk, said the cat joined the group
OL,8,F"blazing the trail at the front" and he
OL,9,Fwas astonished the second car they
OL,10,Fflagged down knew Moonlight Sparkles'
OL,11,Fowner.
